"Hi {customer_firstname},<br><br>Your subscription for {product_name} has "
"renewed successfully."
msgstr ""
"Γειά σου {customer_firstname},<br><br>Η συνδρομή σου για το {product_name} "
"έχει ανανεωθεί επιτυχώς."

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:287
